.TH CLEARERR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
clearerr \- clear a Crunch stream's end-of-file and error indicators
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <stdio.h>
.PP
.BI "void clearerr(struct FILE* " stream ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR clearerr ()
clears both indicators without changing the stream's position or
.BR errno .
A later read at the end of the file can set the end-of-file indicator again.
.SH RETURN VALUE
No value is returned. A null stream sets
.B errno
to
.BR EINVAL ;
null is not a valid C stream argument.
.SH NOTES
Only Crunch streams are supported; they are not C library
.B FILE
objects.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR feof (3crunch),
.BR ferror (3crunch),
.BR fseek (3crunch)
